# Only the web app is tracked. The brain is NEVER committed: it holds ~3,000 rows of NSE prices,
# highs and VWAPs, and this repo is PUBLIC. NSE market-data terms forbid furnishing that data to
# anyone, and derived values count. The git brain-backup layer was retired 2026-07-02, so the old
# !rocket_brain.json exception protected nothing and only risked an accidental publish.
*
!.gitignore
!index.html
!app.js
!styles.css
dev/
